### Get all users (Admin only)
POST http://localhost:5000/admin/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "luid": 1
}

### Change user status (Ban / Unban)
PATCH http://localhost:5000/admin/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "uid": 3,
  "luid": 1
}

### Get all weather forecasts - Admin table view
POST http://localhost:5000/admin/weather
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "luid": 1
}

